   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about transport",
   "texto": [
    "To ask what bus to take, can you say Hvilken buss går til? («What bus is it going to?»). Ta buss means to go by bus; bytte buss, change bus.",
    "The stop can be called stopp or bussholdeplass. Neste means «next» and appears in indications as gå av ved neste stopp («Get off at the next stop.»)."
   ]
